(text "ISOLATION BARRIER: U3, K1, U2 and PS1 straddle it; keep at least 6 mm creepage across it" (at 20.32 112.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 427e757a-e2e0-42d0-a887-fb6c3b64bb79))
(text "MAINS IN, FUSE, SURGE; OUTLET (LIGHT always on, MOTOR controlled)" (at 20.32 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid eef00ba6-8e10-41ac-8ab5-8e30b4298de0))
